{"availability":"available","full":"andshrew/supreme-enigma","name":"supreme-enigma","description":"This repository contains an extract of responses from the Sony PlayStation 5 backwards compatibility status API.","category":"Developer tools","language":null,"stars":21,"forks":2,"created":"2020-09-06T10:22:07Z","updated":"2026-10-12T02:07:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://andshrew.github.io/supreme-enigma/","topics":["backwards-compatibility","ps4","ps5"],"demo":"https://andshrew.github.io/supreme-enigma/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:43:35.181Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T09:43:35.181Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T09:43:35.181Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.471Z","stars":21,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:28.386Z","stars":21,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-12T09:43:35.181Z","stars":21,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sony has an API for retrieving the backward compatibility status of PS4 titles when played on a PS5 system. This API is directly utilised by for displaying the status against the titles in your library, and for determining whether or not the option to allow you to download it to a PS5 should be available.","This repository contains a extract of responses from this API created by submitting known PS4 title IDs (ie. the CUSAxxxxx codes) to it.","This data can be viewed in a friendly table format at courtesy of GitHub Pages and DataTables"],"features":["These descriptions have been sourced from the PlayStation Store.","Due to running a list of known PS4 title IDs through the API to generate this extract there are many titles which are old alpha, beta or demo titles which do not exist in this API and so return no response. All such…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andshrew/supreme-enigma/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"55e334429790755a7e003424fa9666d7205e225f36cb1406fd969f80213baf5c","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:30.810Z"},"ov